<title>AUSTRALIA: Australian metals analyst Bain joins ABN AMRO.</title>
<headline>Australian metals analyst Bain joins ABN AMRO.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian metals analyst Chris Bain has joined ABN AMRO Hoare Govett as a senior analyst, the brokerage said on Monday.</p>
<p>Bain is leaving his post as director of resources research at ANZ Securities to take up the new position.</p>
<p>-- Melbourne bureau 613-9286-1421</p>
